{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261104/photo/bkn-20261104033238386-1104_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261104074636\"/><p>事發在亞士厘道10至14號一單位。(梁國雄攝)</p><p>昨日(3日)晚上11時52分，尖沙咀亞士厘道10至14號一單位，一名78歲印度裔男住戶報案，指發現上址有財物不翼而飛，懷疑被人盜去。</p><p>警員接報到場，經初步點算，相信上址失去一批共值約27萬港元的珠寶。經初步調查，案件列作「盜竊」，暫未有人被捕。據了解，珠寶疑被印度男妻子盜去。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T00:00:33.662043+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":170,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T19:32:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T08:38:24.042367+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T23:58:38.180511+00:00","content_hash":"df65d69aa4dd83ef8404391241d329324ab6a35afd6889f85ea675e15a7fd318","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-04T00:00:33.662043+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}